    export_mod: "Translation only", export_mod_hint: "Translation files to install into game/ of the matching game version.",
    help_img_desc: "Click a card or drag a file from your computer to replace the image with a translated version. Open a card at full size to compare.",
    help_audio_desc: "To load your own voiceover (ogg, mp3, wav), click the download icon on the card or drag a file in. Audio is automatically mapped to script dialogue for convenience.",
    help_editor_1: "Enter translations in the center column. <b>Enter</b> — next line, <b>Shift+Enter</b> — line break, <b>Ctrl+Enter</b> — next untranslated.",
    help_editor_2: "Mind the tags ([ ] and { }) — don't delete or translate them. Click a tag chip under the original to insert it into your translation.",
    help_editor_3: "Save with the <b>Save</b> button. Yellow marks lines carried over from a previous version — review them (the «To review» button in the header).",
    help_editor_4: "Search in the left column filters lines by text or ID. The «Hide translated» toggle leaves only what's left to do.",
    help_editor_5: "The translation assistant translates a selected range of lines via a local model (Ollama) or a cloud API — results fill the fields automatically.",
